# Agent skills are installed into the universal .agents/skills/ folder, which is a local install:
# gitignored, and reproducible from the committed skills-lock.json with `just skills-install`. The
# skills this repository authors live in skills/ and are the only ones another repository installs.
# Per-agent folders (including .claude/) are local too - never commit a copy.
.agents/skills/
.claude/
